#: ../fhir-harness/collab/processes/content/ig-incremental-build.bpmn:301
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Deploy the site built from main or a release. Deploying is release-management, after a human authorised the release — an agent never records that authorisation. A release's files are not deployed to the site: a `v*` tag makes a GitHub draft release carrying them (`ig-release.yml`; skill `ig-binary-artefacts` §\"Releasing\"), which the owner publishes. Report the published URL only once it answers: a returned deploy is not a serving site."
msgstr ""

